<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀτρηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀτρύνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quick,
				nimble, busy, ready</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεράποντε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.321
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.23
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				909
			</span></i>(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.381
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀτρηρὸν . . τὸ ληδάριον
			ἔχεις</span>, comically, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				915
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάζῃ ὀτρηρῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Matro
					<u>Conv.</u>
					92
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀτραλέως</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.735
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύς</span>
			, <i>sharp, cutting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.529
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
